(text "A/B are the same physical contact; C/D are the other. Four terminals captured, not abstract switch contacts.\nMCP23017: address 0x20; initialize outputs low before direction writes; GPA7/GPB7 are output-only.\nSet IOCON MIRROR=1 / ODR=1; INTA reports both button banks. Debounce in firmware. RESET_N has local RC.\nGPB4=AMP_EN, GPB5=MOTOR_EN, GPB6=TFT_RST_N. Unused GPIO set outputs low. FN directly wakes ESP32." (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects(font(size 1.05 1.05))(justify left top)) (uuid "313fa35c-6a80-48f4-a139-d74863059ed4")))
